    "<div style=\"left:0px;top:0px;width:538.84375px;height:18px;font:normal 400 14px Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;color:rgba(141,153,174,1);\">",
    "<div style=\"left:0px;top:0px;height:18px;line-height:18px;\">",
    "Drag a tab by its label. Drop it over the middle of a pane to join that pane, over an </div>",
